{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">港股下跌約300點，跌至25,300點水平。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">騰訊公布業績前，再跌近百分之3。其他科網股亦拖低大市，阿里巴巴、快手和百度，下跌百分之2至3。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-12T05:39:54.181579+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":70,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}